 <shortdesc>Compute y * log2x</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1261216">
   <string>Computes (ST(1) </string><string>* log</string><subscript><string>2</string></subscript><string> (ST(0))), stores the result in register ST(1), and pops the FPU register stack. The source operand in ST(0) must be a non-zero positive number.</string></para>
